      "text": "No.55/1/1/91-Cab.\nGOVERNMENT OF INDIA (BHARAT SARKAR)\nCABINET SECRETARIAT (MANTRIMANDAL SACHIVALAYA)\n\nNew Delhi, the 21st February, 1991\n2 Phalguna, 1912(S)"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 4,
      "poly": [
        75.56,
        203.76,
        540.86,
        203.76,
        540.86,
        762.01,
        75.56,
        762.01
      ],
      "text": "The undersigned is directed to say that with effect from\n20th February, 1991 -\n\n(i) Shri Vidya Charan Shukla has relinquished the office\n of the Minister of External Affairs.\n\n(ii) Shri Shakeelur Rehman has relinquished the office of\n the Minister of Health & Family Welfare.\n\n(iii) Shri Basavaraj Patil has relinquished the office of the\n Minister of State in the Ministry of Steel and Mines.\n\n(iv) Shri Bhagey Gobardhan has relinquished the office of\n the Minister of State in the Ministry of Human Resource\n Development.\n\n(v) Shri Sarwar Hussain has relinquished the office of the\n Minister of State in the Ministry of Food and Civil\n Supplies."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 5,
